    "body": "OK, that makes sense, especially the case of JavaScript-loaded stylesheets.\r\n\r\nOne more thing: how will this interact with user stylesheets and [alternative style sheets](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Alternative_style_sheets)? (There's still potential for color flashing if their color schemes differ from the meta.)",
